{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_error_handling_apperror", "label": "AppError (base error with .status)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/error-handling.md", "source_location": "## Komponen", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A DB query that finds no row does not throw, so without a status-carrying error the controller would return 200 for missing data; AppError carries .status (default 400) so controllers can return the correct HTTP status. New subclasses are only created when a status is reused across many services or instanceof checks are needed elsewhere."}, {"id": "docs_error_handling_notfounderror", "label": "NotFoundError (AppError shortcut, 404)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/error-handling.md", "source_location": "## Komponen", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_error_handling_status_propagation", "label": "Controller status propagation (err.status ?? 400)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/error-handling.md", "source_location": "## Pola di controller", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Controllers pass err.status ?? 400 to error(); errors from parseDbError have no .status and deliberately fall back to 400."}, {"id": "docs_error_handling_yagni_deferrals", "label": "Error-handling YAGNI deferrals (ConflictError 409, UUID param validation)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/error-handling.md", "source_location": "## Kandidat lain yang sengaja belum dibikin (YAGNI)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Deliberately not built yet: ConflictError (409) until 23505 duplicates need a distinct status, and zValidator('param') UUID checks until endpoints are publicly exposed; parseDbError currently returns plain Error for 23505 so it falls to the 400 default."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_error_ha